<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech cenbank offers third 1-wk rev repo at 45 pct.</title>
<headline>Czech cenbank offers third 1-wk rev repo at 45 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech National Bank on Tuesday set its third one-week reverse repo operation of the day, offering to drain an unspecified amount of liquidity from the market at a maximum yield of 45 percent, the bank said.</p>
<p>The first one-week tender on Tuesday had an average accepted yield of 44.43 percent, while no bids were accepted in the second operation, the CNB said.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
